<title>USA: Laboratory Corp gets credit waiver extension.</title>
<headline>Laboratory Corp gets credit waiver extension.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, N.C. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laboratory Corp of America Holdings said it has obtained an extension to March 31 of the waiver of certain covenants to its credit agreement.</p>
</text>
